# <type>: <what changed>            <- imperative, lowercase, max 72 chars
#
# <why it changed>                  <- only when the subject is not enough
#
# type: feat fix refactor perf docs test chore build ci
#
# Pick the type the change actually is. A refactor is not a feat.
# Say what changed, not which files. The diff already lists those.
# No trailing period. No two commits with the same subject.
